  "employETitle": "E. Situs",
  "employEWalk": "<a href=\"/\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/chat.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Obrolan</a> · <a href=\"/employ.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Pakai</a> · <a href=\"/Launch-Ra-Thor.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Luncurkan</a> · <a href=\"/micro-moment.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Momen</a> · <a href=\"/sovereign-shard.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Pecahan</a> · <a href=\"/web-forge.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Tempa</a> · <a href=\"/contact.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Kontak</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">Privasi</a>",
  "employFBody": "AG-SML: pribadi / riset / lepas yang sederhana. Komersial / organisasi / pendapatan → lisensi berbayar. Pakai <a href=\"/contact.html#commercial-inquiry\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">formulir pertanyaan komersial</a> atau tulis <a href=\"mailto:info@Rathor.ai\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">info@Rathor.ai</a>.",
