  "employWrap4": "<strong class=\"text-amber-300\">Backend lokal Lattice Chat</strong> — <a href=\"/chat.html\" class=\"text-amber-300 underline\">/chat.html</a> → <code class=\"text-amber-200\">http://localhost:11434/v1</code>.",
